  "notes": "Image 1 (V1.1 rev1 2020/08/11) shows the top-side headers; image 2 the underside connectors. The artwork covers both LattePanda Alpha and Delta, with variant notes. Left header block notes: I2S, I2C (0v~1.8v), USB2.0, 12V DC Power Input; the RS232/TTL block (RI, CTS, RTS, DSR, SGND, DTR, TXD, RXD, DCD) is printed as 'RS232 (Only on Alpha)' and 'TTL (Only on Delta)'. Right header Arduino block operates at 0v~5v. X is transcribed as printed. Skipped: POWER LED, D13 LED, Arduino RESET and POWER/SW buttons, RTC battery (CR927), M.2 E-key and M-key connectors (feature lists only, no pin labels) and the two coax antenna connectors. The USB2.0 4-pin connector in image 2 is marked 'Available on LattePanda Delta only' and is omitted for Alpha."
}
